stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> SourceReady
  SourceReady --> StagedBlob: Large file and enabled
  SourceReady --> Request: Inline or link
  StagedBlob --> Request: Submit URL
  StagedBlob --> OrphanRisk: Abandon before submit
  Request --> ProviderWork: Validation and plan accepted
  Request --> OrphanRisk: Early return with staged source
  ProviderWork --> ReleaseAttempt: Normal success or terminal failure
  ProviderWork --> UnverifiedWork: Client cancel or platform termination
  ReleaseAttempt --> Released: Deletion succeeds
  ReleaseAttempt --> OrphanRisk: Disabled or failed cleanup
  Released --> [*]
  UnverifiedWork --> OrphanRisk: Independent cleanup not guaranteed
